  "content": "## Comprehensive VA Job Search Plan\n\nThis plan leverages your 5 years of office management experience at a law firm to position you as a strong VA candidate targeting lifestyle, health & wellness, and creative businesses at $20-25/hr remote.\n\n**Phase 1 (Parallel):** Research the current VA job landscape and craft your professional positioning materials simultaneously.\n**Phase 2 (Parallel):** Apply across multiple channels - job platforms, direct outreach, and VA agencies.\n**Phase 3:** Synthesize all results into a prioritized action tracker with next steps.\n\nThe plan focuses on getting you immediate traction by applying to real jobs while also building your professional presence for ongoing opportunities.",
