    {
      "goal": "Create a complete, optimized VA resume and cover letter template for the user. Background: 5 years as office manager at a small law firm handling scheduling, client communication, and basic bookkeeping. Skills: Microsoft Office, Google Workspace, Instagram, Facebook, organization, communication. Target: Virtual Assistant roles in lifestyle/health & wellness/creative businesses, $20-25/hr, remote, EST timezone. The resume should reframe office management experience as VA-ready skills, include a compelling professional summary, and use VA-industry keywords. The cover letter template should have customizable sections for different industries. Output both as formatted text ready to use.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Research and compile a VA profile optimization guide specific to this user: (1) Draft an optimized Upwork profile including title, overview, skills tags, and portfolio suggestions for someone with 5 years law firm office management experience targeting lifestyle/wellness/creative VA work at $20-25/hr. (2) Draft an optimized LinkedIn headline and summary for the same positioning. (3) Identify 3-5 VA-specific agencies/companies (like Belay, Boldly, Time Etc) that hire at $20-25/hr for remote admin roles, and outline their application process and requirements. (4) List 5-10 Facebook groups, Reddit communities, and online communities where VA jobs are posted for the target industries.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
