    {
      "goal": "Create a 90-day VA job search action plan and skills development roadmap. Include: (1) Week-by-week action items for the first 12 weeks covering applications, networking, follow-ups, and skill building. (2) Identify 2-3 free or low-cost certifications/courses that would strengthen the user's VA profile (e.g., project management, CRM tools like Dubsado/HoneyBook common in wellness/creative niches, Canva, basic social media management). (3) Create email outreach templates for cold-pitching VA services directly to small health & wellness businesses, lifestyle bloggers, and creative entrepreneurs. (4) Interview preparation tips specific to VA hiring including common assessment tasks and how to demonstrate reliability remotely.",
